---
---

<section
  id="quickstart"
  class="mt-20 font-display scroll-mt-24"
>
  <h2
    class="text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,1.875rem)] font-medium text-fg leading-tight mb-6 max-w-3xl"
  >
    Quickstart
  </h2>

  <p class="text-[19px] leading-[1.65] text-fg max-w-3xl mb-12">
    Three steps. Python 3.10 or higher.
  </p>

  <div class="space-y-14 max-w-3xl">
    {/* ─── Install ─── */}
    <div>
      <h3
        class="font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-fg-muted mb-4"
      >
        1 &middot; Install
      </h3>
      <pre
        class="font-mono text-[14px] leading-[1.7] bg-bg-elev text-fg rounded-xl px-6 py-5 overflow-x-auto ring-1 ring-line"><code>git clone https://github.com/JinghangLi/vlapilot.git
cd vlapilot
pip install -e ".[examples]"</code></pre>
    </div>

    {/* ─── Configure ─── */}
    <div>
      <h3
        class="font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-fg-muted mb-4"
      >
        2 &middot; Configure
      </h3>
      <p class="text-[18px] leading-[1.65] text-fg mb-4">
        Copy the template into
        <strong class="font-semibold">~/.vlapilot/</strong>, then fill in your
        API keys and point
        <strong class="font-semibold">agent.mission_dir</strong> at a mission
        folder.
      </p>
      <pre
        class="font-mono text-[14px] leading-[1.7] bg-bg-elev text-fg rounded-xl px-6 py-5 overflow-x-auto ring-1 ring-line"><code>mkdir -p ~/.vlapilot
cp config.example.json ~/.vlapilot/config.json

# Then edit ~/.vlapilot/config.json:
#   agent.planner.api_key        — LLM key for the planner
#   agent.verify.providers.*     — VLM key for the verifier
#   agent.mission_dir            — path to a mission directory</code></pre>
    </div>

    {/* ─── Run ─── */}
    <div>
      <h3
        class="font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-fg-muted mb-4"
      >
        3 &middot; Run
      </h3>
      <p class="text-[18px] leading-[1.65] text-fg mb-4">
        Drive it directly from the CLI for a one-shot mission:
      </p>
      <pre
        class="font-mono text-[14px] leading-[1.7] bg-bg-elev text-fg rounded-xl px-6 py-5 overflow-x-auto ring-1 ring-line"><code>python scripts/run_agent.py \
  --config ~/.vlapilot/config.json \
  -i "Clean up everything on the desk."</code></pre>

      <p class="text-[18px] leading-[1.65] text-fg mt-7 mb-4">
        Or expose it as an MCP server so any upstream agent can drive it:
      </p>
      <pre
        class="font-mono text-[14px] leading-[1.7] bg-bg-elev text-fg rounded-xl px-6 py-5 overflow-x-auto ring-1 ring-line"><code>vlapilot --config ~/.vlapilot/config.json</code></pre>

      <p class="text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-fg-muted mt-4 font-mono">
        Tools exposed: start_mission &middot; get_status &middot;
        cancel_mission &middot; list_capabilities
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
